# Feature Showcase

Every inline decoration: *strong*, /emphasis/, _underline_, ~strikethrough~, =highlighted= text, and */bold italic/*. A link with a footnote.^[Inline footnote content, rendered as an endnote.]

Superscript{^note^} and subscript{,index,} both render as decorations.

An image resolves relative to the `.crv` file, via the injected `<base href>`:

![Four colored circles labeled Light, Medium, Dark, and French](assets/page-1-figure-1.png) {#figure-1}
^ Figure 1: the four roast stages, lightest to darkest

## Table with row and column spans

|= Region |= Q1 |= Q2 |= Q3 |
| EMEA | 12 | 15 | 19 |
| APAC | 8 | 11 | 22 |
| ^ | 20 | < | 25 |

The `^` in the last row extends the “APAC” cell down two rows; the `<` merges into the cell on its left.

